The deletions may also delete, update, or insert rows of audit.events, shop.category_labels, shop.totals, stats.a, stats.b, and 1 more table beyond what the plan shows, which allow_unplanned_changes in kortopi.toml allows.
The database has no tables shop.archive and stats."my view", which allow_unplanned_changes in kortopi.toml names.
Partitions are checked with the partitioned tables at the top of their trees, so allow_unplanned_changes in kortopi.toml does not cover partitions audit.log_1 of audit.log and audit.log_2 of audit.log: name audit.log instead.
